.skamyxatra

You need to separate sentences with "{.i}."

> mi jersi do mu'i mo

That should be "{mu'i ma}."  "{mo}" is the {selbri} interrogative, while "{ma}"
is the {sumti} interrogative.

> goi mu'i do ____ mi

I'm not sure what you're trying to attach "{goi}" to here (or even if you're
using it remotely properly), but "{mu'i}," when used as a {sumti tcita}, must
be followed by a {sumti}, usually one that uses an abstraction.  In this case,
it seems that you want "{mu'i lonu do ____ mi}."

mu'omi'e .kamymecraijun.

